<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Our Menu</h2>
<p>

</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Enjoy great food with a side of fresh air! Our restaurant offers a delicious menu of crowd-pleasing favourites, now even better with our <strong>spacious outdoor seating area</strong>. Whether you&#8217;re catching up over coffee, sharing a family meal, or sipping something cold in the sun, our outdoor space is the perfect place to relax and dine al fresco. Come for the food, stay for the vibe — we’ve saved you a seat!</p>
<p>

</p>
<div class="wp-block-buttons is-content-justification-left is-layout-flex wp-container-core-buttons-is-layout-b080bfe2 wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
