<p></p>
<div class="wp-block-group is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow" style="padding-top: 20%; padding-bottom: 20%;">
<p></p>
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Function Suite</h2>
<p>

</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Looking for the perfect space to bring people together? Our function suite offers a warm, flexible setting for every occasion — from celebrations like birthdays and anniversaries to respectful funeral gatherings and live music events. With a fully licensed bar, catering options, and a welcoming atmosphere, we’re here to help make your event personal, memorable, and stress-free.</p>
<p>

</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Get in touch today to book your date, arrange a viewing, or fill out our online booking form to make a provisional enquiry.</p>
<p>

</p>
<div class="wp-block-buttons is-layout-flex wp-block-buttons-is-layout-flex">
<p></p>
<div class="wp-block-button is-style-fill"><a class="wp-block-button__link wp-element-button" href="https://portcullis-arbroath.co.uk/functions/">Function suite</a></div>
<p></p>
</div>
<p></p>
</div>
<p></p>
</div>
<figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img decoding="async" width="1512" height="2016" data-attachment-id="88" data-permalink="https://portcullis-arbroath.co.uk/about/img-20250506-wa00081-2/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/portcullis-arbroath.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-20250506-wa00081-1.jpg?fit=1512%2C2016&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="1512,2016" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="IMG-20250506-WA0008[1]" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/portcullis-arbroath.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-20250506-wa00081-1.jpg?fit=768%2C1024&amp;ssl=1" data-recalc-dims="1" class="wp-image-88 size-full" style="object-position: 50% 50%;" src="https://i0.wp.com/portcullis-arbroath.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-20250506-wa00081-1.jpg?ssl=1" alt="" /></figure>
