<figure class="wp-block-media-text__media"><img loading="lazy" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="2016" height="1512" data-attachment-id="86" data-permalink="https://portcullis-arbroath.co.uk/about/img-20250506-wa00021-2/" data-orig-file="https://i0.wp.com/portcullis-arbroath.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-20250506-wa00021-1.jpg?fit=2016%2C1512&amp;ssl=1" data-orig-size="2016,1512" data-comments-opened="1" data-image-meta="{&quot;aperture&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;credit&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;camera&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;caption&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;created_timestamp&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;copyright&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;focal_length&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;iso&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;shutter_speed&quot;:&quot;0&quot;,&quot;title&quot;:&quot;&quot;,&quot;orientation&quot;:&quot;0&quot;}" data-image-title="IMG-20250506-WA0002[1]" data-image-description="" data-image-caption="" data-large-file="https://i0.wp.com/portcullis-arbroath.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-20250506-wa00021-1.jpg?fit=1024%2C768&amp;ssl=1" data-recalc-dims="1" class="wp-image-86 size-full" style="object-position: 50% 50%;" src="https://i0.wp.com/portcullis-arbroath.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/img-20250506-wa00021-1.jpg?ssl=1" alt="" /></figure>
<div class="wp-block-media-text__content">
<p></p>
<div class="wp-block-group is-layout-flow wp-block-group-is-layout-flow" style="padding-top: 20%; padding-bottom: 20%;">
<p></p>
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Games room</h2>
<p>

</p>
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">Step into our lively Games Room — the perfect hangout spot for casual fun and friendly competition. Featuring <strong> pool tables</strong> and<strong> professional dart boards</strong>, there’s plenty of action for seasoned players and first-timers alike. With <strong>room for table top games</strong> and board game nights, it&#8217;s a welcoming space to relax, challenge your mates, and enjoy a few pints in good company. Whether you&#8217;re aiming for the bullseye or racking up a win in Monopoly, this is where great games and great laughs come together.</p>
<p></p>
</div>
<p></p>
</div>
</div>
<p></p>
</div>
