<h2 class="wp-block-heading has-contrast-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-ad46b4384d9dc254fca5f11f31d1ab4f" style="text-transform:none">Weekly Specials</h2>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">🎉 <strong>DEAL DAYS at The Portcullis Arbroath!</strong> 🍽️🍻<br><strong>Great Food, Amazing Value, Every Week!</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">🍴 <strong>Pensioner Lunchtime Deal</strong> (Over 60&#8217;s)<br><strong>Mon-Fri (12–2pm)</strong></p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">3 Courses for just £10!<br>Perfect for your lunch break, a catch-up with friends, or a midweek treat. Delicious dishes without breaking the bank!</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">👶 <strong>Children Eat Free – Every Wednesday!</strong><br>Bring the little ones – we’ll treat them to a free kids&#8217; meal with every adult main. Midweek meals made easy (and affordable)!</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">🥩 <strong>Weekday Deal </strong><br><strong>Mon-Fri (5pm-8pm)</strong><br>Hearty Pub Classics Without the Weekend Price.<br> &#8211; Two courses  £16.50 <br> &#8211; Three courses £21.00</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">📍<strong>The Portcullis Arbroath – Where every day’s a deal and every visit’s a good time!</strong><br>Book your table now or just drop in – we’ll keep the grill hot and the games room ready!</p>
</div>
</div>
